# A shield without a base colour has base_color "", which no item accepts, so it is rebuilt without one.
$execute if data storage totem_shield:root data."$(UUID)".shield{base_color:""} run return run function totem_shield:app/shield/offhand/replace_undyed with storage totem_shield:root data."$(UUID)".shield
$function totem_shield:app/shield/offhand/replace with storage totem_shield:root data."$(UUID)".shield